WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
The edge of the glass, catching the light.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Along the pane, sky and a single tree held in the glass.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Down the mullion, past a square, sealed joint.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Toward the threshold, in a hard diagonal of afternoon light.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A door opens on its hinges.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Through the clear opening.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Inside, the lobby and its glass office fronts.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Blue hour, warm behind the glass.
